# Lionic

> Lionic is a network security company based in Taiwan. It provides in-house Deep Packet Inspection (DPI) engines for licensing and integration, next-generation firewall appliances, and mobile security apps.

Use Licensing pages when integrating security into routers, customer premises equipment (CPE), or embedded devices. Use Products pages when choosing a next-generation firewall (NGFW) appliance or mobile app.
Core capabilities include anti-virus, intrusion prevention (IPS), malicious-URL blocking, Application Visibility & Control (AVC), web content filtering, device fingerprinting, and Quality of Service (QoS).
Internal informational links below point to Markdown versions of the pages. For forms, downloads, or interactive features, open the HTML page identified by the Markdown page's Source URL.
The site is multilingual: English is at `https://www.lionic.com/`, Traditional Chinese at `https://www.lionic.com/zh-tw/`, and Japanese at `https://www.lionic.com/ja-jp/`. Prefer English URLs below unless the user asks for another language; translated Markdown pages use the same path with `/zh-tw` or `/ja-jp` prefixed.
For partnership, pricing, or trials, use Contact. For threat verification, use the Free URL Check service. For site-wide discovery, see the sitemap.

